{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 24, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B24", "text_preview": "中文"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 25, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B25", "text_preview": "日本語"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 26, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B26", "text_preview": "한국어"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 27, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B27", "text_preview": "The revision history of a page is viewed by clicking on the View history tab.\nOne can then select any two revisions and click Compare selected revisions to view the diff .\nContents of deleted revisions will not be accessible to users lackin"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 28, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B28", "text_preview": "Summary"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 29, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B29", "text_preview": "The page shows the newest changes first, followed by older ones."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 30, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B30", "text_preview": "To view a specific version, click its date."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 31, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B31", "text_preview": "Click cur to compare an old version with a current one."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 32, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B32", "text_preview": "Click prev to compare a version with its predecessor."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 33, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B33", "text_preview": "To compare two versions, select the left button for the older version and the right button for the newer one. Afterward, click the Compare selected revisions button."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 34, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B34", "text_preview": "A minor edit is indicated with m ."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 35, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B35", "text_preview": "Searching for a revision"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 36, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B36", "text_preview": "Users can use the Wikiblame tool to search for revisions from a specific author, or character strings in the page of any revision."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 37, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B37", "text_preview": "Navigating the revision history page"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 38, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B38", "text_preview": "Here's what a page history looks like in the default skin."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 39, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B39", "text_preview": "Let's examine each labeled function:"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 40, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B40", "text_preview": "\"Revision history\" is suffixed to the page name."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 41, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B41", "text_preview": "This displays the last 50 edits after the ones listed currently."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-mediawiki-revision-discussion--b35a85e4/document.md", "ordinal": 42, "selector": "web://cb900a0538d7fd1a#B42", "text_preview": "These numbers tell you how many changes you can see listed on a page: 20, 50, 100, 250, or 500."}
